{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_210","type":"agent_message","text":"All 10 target-scope artifacts are implemented and verified. Summary of the work:\n\n**Implementation (all created)**\n- `scripts/lib/paired-ablation.mjs` — pure-function paired-ablation aggregator (reuses E01's `aggregateReliability` for pass^k; adds paired t-test, Cohen's d, deterministic bootstrap 95% CI, per-condition metric p50/p95, latency p50/p95, tokens proxy, false-block rate, safety count, degradation budget, verdict/gate).\n- `scripts/lib/paired-ablation.d.mts` — types for the above.\n- `shared/agent-dev/paired-ablation-fixture.json` — pre-registered deterministic corpus: 24 cases × 3 repeats × 2 conditions, seed `20261013`, `passThreshold 0.6`, primary metric `protectedRetention`, budget `falseBlockRate≤0.05 / latencyP95Ms≤50 / safetyViolations=0`; protected procedural facts first under capacity pressure.\n- `tests/unit/agent-dev-paired-ablation.test.ts` — 16 aggregation/fixture cases (pass^k, zero/negative honesty, unverified effect, insufficient-sample, safety, budget regression, incomplete preservation, stats helpers).\n- `tests/unit/runtime-memory-paired-ablation.test.ts` — 5 cases driving the real `RuntimeMemoryStore` (`fifo` baseline vs `importance` treatment), isolated stores, fixed insertion order, paired seed.\n- `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-paired-ablation.md`, `harness/specs/rules/paired-ablation-boundary.md`, `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e02-paired-ablation.md`, `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e02-acceptance.json`, `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/E02-SHA256SUMS`.\n\n**Measured result (real store, deterministic fixture)**\n- Component effect verified on 24/24 cases; baseline `pass^k=0` vs treatment `pass^k=1`; protected retention mean `0.0167 → 1`; false-block rate `0.9792 → 0`; latency p95 `0.68ms → 0.75ms`; tokens proxy `9720 → 8370`; `meanDiff 0.9833`, Cohen's d `24.63`, 95% CI `[0.9583, 1.0]`, `verdict=positive`, `gate=pass`. Product default `fifo` unchanged; no provider/human data.\n\n**Honest gaps** — verbatim `vitest`/`tsgo`/`eslint` and `harness run --dry-run` could not run here (no `node_modules`, no `.git`); the two committed suites were executed via Node type stripping with a vitest-compatible stub (module-specifier rewrites only) at 21/21 passing, and acceptance/README notes record this. `scripts/repository-artifacts.json` was intentionally left untouched (matching the E01 packet).\n\n{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Implemented E02: a paired, pre-registered baseline-vs-treatment ablation of the real Phase-4 type-aware eviction (RuntimeMemoryStore.evictionPolicy 'importance') against pre-Phase-4 FIFO ('fifo') using a deterministic local fixture (24 cases x 3 repeats x 2 conditions). Added scripts/lib/paired-ablation.mjs (+.d.mts) which reuses E01's pass^k contract and reports success, pass^k, p50/p95 latency, tokens proxy, false blocks, safety violations, effect size and a deterministic 95% bootstrap CI, plus the harness task spec, rule spec, evidence doc, acceptance JSON, SHA256SUMS, and two unit suites. Component effect was verified on 24/24 cases; measured treatment pass^k=1 vs baseline 0, meanDiff 0.9833, Cohen's d 24.63, 95% CI [0.9583,1.0], false-block rate 0.9792->0, no safety violation, within the pre-registered budget, gate=pass. Zero/negative-effect paths are covered by tests and reported honestly; no product default, lock, approval, provider call, or README change. Checks not runnable in this dependency-free sandbox (vitest/tsgo/eslint verbatim, harness run --dry-run) are recorded as not-run in the acceptance evidence; the committed test files were executed through Node type stripping with a stub vitest runner (21/21 passing).\",\"testsRun\":[\"node --check scripts/lib/paired-ablation.mjs (exit 0)\",\"node <driver: real RuntimeMemoryStore + fixture + aggregatePairedAblation> (exit 0; 24/24 component-effect, gate=pass)\",\"node <driver running tests/unit/agent-dev-paired-ablation.test.ts + tests/unit/runtime-memory-paired-ablation.test.ts via Node type stripping and a vitest-compatible stub> (exit 0; TOTAL 21 FAILS 0)\",\"node -e <fixture shape assertions: 24 cases, repeats=3, 2 conditions, protected facts first, facts>maxFacts> (exit 0)\",\"node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-paired-ablation.md --no-diff (exit 0: Spec is valid)\",\"node harness/src/cli.mjs context --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-paired-ablation.md (exit 0; no missing rules/scenarios)\",\"node scripts/check-no-bom.mjs (exit 0)\",\"node -e verifyManifest(docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/E02-SHA256SUMS) (checked=9 matched=9 missing=0 drifted=0 malformed=0)\",\"credential scan over 10 touched files (hits=0)\"]}"}}
